<title>SINGAPORE: TACC 1996 net profit up 43.62 percent.</title>
<headline>TACC 1996 net profit up 43.62 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the year ending Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>	    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earings per share (baht)    7.26   vs  6.68</p>
<p>    Net profit  (billion)	 2.74   vs  1.91</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Total Access Communication Public Co Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
